  "controls": "Front ground faces and upper recess measured independently. The projecting balcony, cornices, parapet cap, curved corner face and east return are not anchors. Lower west edge behind tree presents the largest uncertainty. Upper west straight wall at 97px near y273, at the outer corner of brick side building. An out-of-plane eave reaches x80. An upright pipe left of the set-back upper storeys reaches x75.",
